TEST(7)

# NAME

test - scdoc feature test

# SYNOPSIS

*test* [_OPTIONS_] <file>

# DESCRIPTION

This is a test document for the scdoc man page generator.

It is written for the Packit core repository scdoc test script.

# OPTIONS

*-h*, *--help*
	Show help information.

*-v*, *--version*
	Show version information.

*-o* <file>
	Write output to _file_.

# INTERESTING STORY

This test file was created by some extraterrestrial being far away
from Earth. It was transmitted from a planet in the Third Universe,
approximately 100,000,000,000 light-years from the Sun. Any
resemblance to a scdoc test file is purely coincidental. It turned
out to be an accurate test file for scdoc, which is why we used it
in Packit.

Please don't tell anyone you've found this!

# SEE ALSO

*man*(1), *printf*(3), *sh*(1)

# AUTHORS

Written by someone far away from earth for testing purposes.

# BUGS

If this document fails to render correctly, scdoc is not working correctly.
Please raise an issue on pack-it/core.
